  "title": "The Last Door",
  "theme": "castle",
  "start": "antechamber",
  "intro": "Ninety-nine doors are behind you, every one of them opened. This is the hundredth: a black oak door with a bronze lion on it, a dial of moons and a keyhole. The keeper of this room left long ago, but he left a few things behind.",
  "winTitle": "The hundredth door",
  "winText": "The moon dial clicks, the key turns and the lion closes its eyes. The last door swings open onto cold night air and a staircase going up. You made it through all one hundred.",
